      "content": "yeah the briefing sounds good. but i also want to make sure there isn't any \"chaos\" or little errors popping up in the middle of the service that we didn't account for. like, what are some common \"hidden\" risks or small things that usually go wrong in these big setups that i should be on the lookout for?",
